            </note>
            <note corresp="#d86-f2" n="89" xml:id="d86-f2-content">
                <p>Washington Conversations on International Organization, held at Dumbarton Oaks,
                    Washington, D. C.: First phase, August 21–September 28, 1944, United States,
                    United Kingdom, Union of Soviet Socialist Republics; second phase, September
                    29–October 7, United States, United Kingdom, China. For correspondence, see <ref
                        target="frus1944v01#pg_713">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp.
                        713</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
